WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.518
Today we will use voice, space and roles to tell a story. Our work connects with

00:00:05.518 --> 00:00:06.515
communities across Africa.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:10.588
Assign a speaker, listener and narrator for a short scene.

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:14.821
Practise lines with clear facial expression and turn-taking.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:21.101
Act the scene once and revise a confusing gesture. Explain one respectful similarity

00:00:21.101 --> 00:00:23.593
or difference with another African example.
